          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku dimu mwana kaSawulu Jonatani wamwilili mukwenziwasendeli yitwa yindi, nindi, Twatuyi kudi mashidika awaFwilistinu adi mwishinadi. Hamulejelumu tata yinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu washakaminikunsa yaGibeya mwishina damubula wekala muMiŋironi. Antu adiŋiyi nawu adiŋi kwiji neyi amayala makulakaji atanu nadimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niAhiya mwana kaAhitubi, mana kwaikabodi, mwana kaFwinehasi, Fwinehasi mwana kaEli, kapristu kaYehova kamuShilo, navwali ifwodi. Antu hiyelukili nawuJonatani nayuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakachi kayibukubuku kwakeŋa eli kuhitayi Jonatani nindi ayi kudimashidika awaFwilistinu hadiŋi ishinadi dimu ilola deneni, ishinadi dikwawu ilola deneni. Dimu ijina dadu Bozezi, di kwawu ijina dadu Sene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iloladeneni dimu demana kwakwihi naMikimashi mbadi yakabeta kakuchimunswa, di kwawu demana kwakwihi naGeba mbadi yakabeta kakuchidiilu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonatani wamwilili mukwenzi wasendeli yitwa yindi nindi, Twatuyikudi mashidika awayidima awa, wamba kela Yehova wukutukoŋela chuma; kudi Yehova kudi chuma chakumukaŋesha? Wukwamwina tuhu helanawamavulu hela nawantesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwakusenda yitwa yindi hakumwila nindi, Ilaku tuhu mwonsu munayi muchima weyi. Tuyi, nidi neyi hohumwonsu muwunakeŋeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonatani nindi, Tala, tukuya kwishinadi kudiawa antu, tukudimwekesha kudi wena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi akutwila nawu, Imanenutuyiwani, twakemana kwetu hitwakakandama kudi wenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa neyiakutwila nawu, Inzenu kunu kutudi, tukukandama; netu komana Yehova natwinkuwu dehi mumakasetu. Chikwikala chinjikijilu chetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wejima wawu ayedi hiyakudimwekesha kudi mashidika awaFwilistinu. AFwilistinu hiyakwila nawu, Talenu, aHeberu hiyakwidika mumena mwabataminuwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mashidika hiyakuyila ajonatani namukwakusenda yitwa yindi, nawu, Kandamenu kunu kutudetu tuyilejuhu chuma. Jonatani hakumwila mukwakusenda yitwa yindi, nindi, Nlondelaŋa munyima, Yehova nayihanidehi kudi aIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonatani hakukandamina nikumakasa nikunyendu, nimukwakusenda yitwa yindi namukumi munyima. Adimbukili kumesuajonatani. Nimukwakusenda yitwa yindi wamulondeli munyima nakutapana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hásambilili kuyitapawu kudi ajonatani namukwakusenda yitwayindi atapili antu makumi ayedi mwiluŋa dakweseka munkela yakudimamuntu ifuku dimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimuchilombu, nimumpata, nimukachi kawantu ejiraa mwadiŋi kwakuza alaza ala hohu. Nimashidika ashiluwu kwenoku, niakwakupupa hiyakuza ala nawa niwena. Niiseki dikanka nikukanka. Kwadiŋi kuzaala kwakweni kwabadika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakutalatala aSawulu amuGibeya wakuBenjamini atalili, amweniluntu hilukuya nakunowa hohu, hilukuya niniku niniku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu hakuyilaantu adiŋiyi nawu, nindi, Chindenu mwani mutali nafumuhu. Chachindiluwu amweni Jonatani namukwakusenda yitwa yindi hosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu hakumwila Ahiya, nindi, Leta chimbaŋu chaNzambi kunu. Muloŋa henohu chimbaŋu chaNzambi chadiŋi kwadi ŋuwu anyana kaIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu chadiŋiyi nakuhosha nakapristu ipumba dadipi muchilombu chawaFwilistinu hidikusweja nikusweja. Sawulu hakumwila kapristu nindi, Fumishaku chikasa cheyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu nawantu ejima adiŋiyi nawuhiyakupompa hiyakuya kunjita. Hiyakumona antu ejima adi nakudi tapa, mwawu, mwawu, kwadiŋi kujilumuka kwakweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NiaHeberu ásambilili kukuma kudi aFwilistinu, hiyakufuma kumpata yadiŋi kwakwihi, hiyakuyanawu kuchilombu, hiyakubalumuka, hiyakudibomba nawaIsarela adi ijina waSawulu najonatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chochimu nawa aIsarela ejima abatamini mwituŋa daEfweremi damapidi, niwena chatiyiluwu nawu, aFwilistinu hiya kutemoka, hiyakuyihaŋa nankashi nakuyasa njita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Denodu ifuku Yehova waamwinini aIsarela. Njita yashi kili nikuBetaveni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela akabakeni denodu ifuku, muloŋa Sawulu washipeni nindi, iyala wakadyahu yakudya hikuchidi kanda kwili melela akekali washipewa, kulonda niditendi kudi ayilumbu jami. Nochu hosi muntu watompeliya kudyaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ejima hiyakushika mwisapa danyitondu. Hamaseki hadiniwuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu chashikiluwu mwisaŋodu hiyakumona wuchi wudi nakuvwa, hosi washili chikasa kukanwaku, muloŋa antu atiyili woma weshiŋu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Denodu ifuku atapili aFwilistinu, kufumisha kuMikimashi nakushikani kuAyiji aloni. Antu aswejeli kuzeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu hiyakulotokela hayuma yapupiluwu, hiyakukwata ninyikoku, niŋombi, ninyana kaŋombi, hiyakuyitapila hamaseki. Antu hiyakudiila kumu nimashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumuleja muSawulu nawu, Tala antu hiyakumuvulu muna Yehova, hiyakudiila kumunimashi. Yena nindi, Munakoŋi chatama; nkundumwinenu lelu iloladeneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu nindi, Mwaŋelenu mukachi kawantu mwakayili akanleteliwejima wawu ŋombi jawu, ninyikoku yawu, akayitapili kunu, akadyi; akabuli kumuvulumuna Yehova nakudiila kumu nimashi. Antu hiyakuleta ŋombi jawu wejima wawu wowena wufuku owu, hiyakuyitapila kwenoku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu hakunamutuŋila Yehova kameŋa, diku kameŋa kakusambila kanamutuŋililiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu hakwila nindi, Tukunku mukenu nakuyilondela aFwilistinu nawufuku, twakayipupi pupe-e nichi kwakacha, bayi tushiya hoku muntuni wumuku. Hiyakwila nawu, Ilaku mwonsu muwunatiyili kuwaha. Dichi kapristu hakwila nindi, Tukundamenu kunu kwakwihi naNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu hakumwihula Nzambi nindi, Nukuku nkumuka nakulondela aFwilistinu, tahindi? Wukuyihana kudi aIsarela, tahindi? Denodu ifuku hamwakwili kwinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu nindi, Kundamenu kunu enu atulambatwa wantu wejima wenu, tushinshikenu, tumoni navulumuni lelu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa, hela himwanami Jonatani, wakafwa hohu chalala, chahandayi Yehova mukwakwamwina aIsarela kwaamu! Hosi muntu niwumu wamwakwiluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyila aIsarela ejima nindi, Imanenu mutamba wumu, amina mwanami Jonatani twimani mutamba wukwawu. Antu hiyakumwila Sawulu, nawu, Ilaku mwonsu muwunatiyili kuwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu hakumwila Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela, nindi, Mwekeshaku mwalala. Akwata ajonatani naSawulu. Antu apuluka nikupuluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu nindi, Sakulenu nachinjikijilu chakusakula nachu hadi ami namwanami Jonatani. Akwata ngonatani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu hakumwila Jonatani, nindi, Nleji chiwuneli. Jonatani hakumuleja nindi, Nakumina dakutompa tuwuchi kunsa yambwe chiya diŋi kuchikasa chami, komana yami nukufwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu, nindi, Eyi Jonatani wukufwa hohu chalala, neyi nehi, Nzambi aŋili mwomumu nichakubadikamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu hiyakumwila Sawulu, nawu, Jonatani nakoŋi wamwinu wushikaha muIsarela afwi? Chinjila! Chahandayi Yehova kwaamu, hikwakaholoka lusuki lwakunamutu windi nilumu hamasekuku; muloŋa lelu nakoŋi chimu naNzambi. Antu amupulwishili Jonatani, hafwiluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu hakufuntamu, kulondela aFwilistinu nehi, aFwilistinu niwena hiyakuya kwawu kwafuminuwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chelili Sawulu natambuli dehi wanta waIsarela hakulwaŋa nawayilu mbujindi ejima mbadi jejima, nawaMowabi, nawanyana kaAmoni, naEdomi, nawanyanta akuZoba, niaFwilistinu. Kwonsu kwatalishiliyi wayitapili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafumbili njita, watapili aAmaleki, wapulwishili aIsarela kudi ayipupilaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaSawulu amayala, iwu Jonatani, iwu Ishivi, iwu Malikishuwa; majina awanyanindi awambanda, wawedi ijina dindi Merabi, wakansi ijina dindi Mikali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iŋoda Sawulu ijina dindi Ahinowami mwana ka-Ahimayazi. Mukulumpi wanjita yindi ijina dindi Abineri, mwana kaNeri, mandumi yaSawulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kishi diyi tata yaSawulu. Neri tata yaAbineri diyi mwana kaAbiyeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyaka yaSawulu yejima hadiŋi njita yakala nawaFwilistinu. Sawulu welilaŋa neyi namoni hela chilobu, hela iyala waŋovu, hakumutambula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
